      "solution": "<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">5</span> + (1/x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">5</span>) = {x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span> + (1/x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>)} × {x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + 1/x<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>} - {x + (1/x)}</p>\n\n<p data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;\">⇒ (- 198) × 34 - (- 6) ⇒ (- 6732) + 6 = - 6726</p>\n",
