    {
      "id": "1a1e8ecf68c0-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If x 3 + y 3 + z 3 = 3 (1 + xyz), P = y + z - x, Q = z + x - y and R = x + y - z, then what is the value of P 3 + Q 3 + R 3 - 3 PQR?",
      "questionHtml": "If x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = 3 (1 + xyz), P = y + z - x, Q = z + x - y and R = x + y - z, then what is the value of P<sup>3</sup> + Q<sup>3</sup> + R<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 3 PQR?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "9",
          "html": "9"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Given:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ y</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ z</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 3 (1 + xyz)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">P = y + z - x</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Q = z + x - y</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">R = x + y - z</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><strong>Formula Used:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&nbsp;a&sup3; + b&sup3; + c&sup3; - 3&times;abc = (a + b + c) &times; (a&sup2; + b&sup2; + c&sup2; - ab - ac - bc)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">By value method,&nbsp;y = z = 0</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Therefore,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ y<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ z<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;= 3 (1 + xyz)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; x<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ 0 + 0&nbsp;= 3</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; x<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;= 3&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(1)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">P = 0&nbsp;+ 0&nbsp;- x = - x</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Q = 0&nbsp;+ x - 0 = x</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">R =&nbsp;x + 0&nbsp;- 0&nbsp;= x</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Now,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">P<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ Q<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ R<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 3PQR</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; -x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ x<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+&nbsp;3x<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 4x<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 4&nbsp;&times; 3&nbsp;(from eq.1)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;12</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The value of P<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ Q<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ R<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span>- 3PQR is 12.</span></p>\n",
