      "id": "1a1e8ecf68c0-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If ab + bc + ca = 0, then find the value of \\(\\rm \\frac{1}{a^2-b c}+\\frac{1}{b^2-c a}+\\frac{1}{c^2-a b}\\) .",
      "questionHtml": "If ab + bc + ca = 0, then find the value of <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{1}{a^2-b c}+\\frac{1}{b^2-c a}+\\frac{1}{c^2-a b}\\)</span>.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\rm \\frac{1}{abc}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{1}{abc}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "ab",
          "html": "ab"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Shortcut Trick</u></span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>Value putting method:</p>\n\n<p>a = 2, b = -1 , c = 2 (as it satisfied ab +&nbsp;bc + ca = 0)</p>\n\n<p>So,</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{1}{a^2-b c}+\\frac{1}{b^2-c a}+\\frac{1}{c^2-a b}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{1}{4+2}+\\frac{1}{1-4}+\\frac{1}{4+2}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 1/6 - 1/3 + 1/6</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; (1 -2 + 1)/6</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; (2 - 2)/6 = 0/6 = 0</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The correct answer is option (1).</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>ab + bc + ca = 0</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>ab + bc + ca = 0</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; -bc = ab + ac</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;&ndash; bc =&nbsp;a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ ab + ac</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1/(a<sup>2</sup> &ndash; bc) = 1/(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + ac)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ---- (i)</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1/(b<sup>2</sup> &ndash; ca) = 1/(b<sup>2 </sup>+ ab + bc)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ---- (ii)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1/(c<sup>2</sup> &ndash; ab) = 1/(c<sup>2</sup> + bc + ca)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ---- (iii)</p>\n\n<p>Adding i, ii, iii we get the required expression.</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\;\\left( {\\frac{1}{{{a^2} - bc}}\\; + \\;\\frac{1}{{{b^2} - ca}}\\; + \\;\\frac{1}{{{c^2} - ab}}} \\right)\\;\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\( \\;\\left( {\\frac{1}{{a\\left( {a\\; + \\;b\\; + \\;c} \\right)}}\\; + \\;\\frac{1}{{b\\left( {a\\; + \\;b\\; + \\;c} \\right)}}\\; + \\;\\frac{1}{{c\\left( {a\\; + \\;b\\; + \\;c} \\right)}}} \\right)\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; [1/(a + b + c)]&nbsp;&times; [(1/a) + (1/b) + (1/c)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (ab + bc + ca) / (a + b + c)abc</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 0 /&nbsp;</span>(a + b + c)abc&nbsp; (∵&nbsp;ab + bc + ca = 0)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 0&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value is 0.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
