      "id": "1a1e8ecf68c0-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "If (5x - 3) 3 + (3x - 5) 3 + (3x - 1) 3 = 45 (x - \\(\\frac 3 5\\) ) (3x - 5) (x - \\(\\frac 1 3\\) ), then what will be the value of ( \\(\\frac {11} 9\\) x + 5) 3 ?",
      "questionHtml": "If (5x - 3)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ (3x - 5)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ (3x - 1)<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>= 45 (x -&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac 3 5\\)</span>) (3x - 5) (x - <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac 1 3\\)</span>), then what will be the value of (<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac {11} 9\\)</span>x + 5)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "343",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">343</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "125",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">125</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "216",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">216</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "181",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">181</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(5x - 3)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 1)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">= 45 (x -&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac 3 5\\)</span><span style=\"\">) (3x - 5) (x -&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac 1 3\\)</span><span style=\"\">)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>If (a + b + c) = 0</p>\n\n<p>Then a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(5x - 3)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 1)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">= 45 (x -&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac 3 5\\)</span><span style=\"\">) (3x - 5) (x -&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac 1 3\\)</span><span style=\"\">)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;(5x - 3)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 1)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">= 45 (&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac {5x -3}{5}\\)</span><span style=\"\">) (3x - 5)(&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac {3x-1}{3}\\)</span><span style=\"\">)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;(5x - 3)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 1)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">= 3(5x - 3)</span><span style=\"\">(3x - 5)</span><span style=\"\">(3x - 1)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">So,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(5x - 3)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 5)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ (3x - 1) = 0</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5x - 3 + 3x - 5 + 3x - 1 = 0</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 11x - 9 = 0</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 11x&nbsp;= 9</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; x = 9/11</span></p>\n\n<p>Now,</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac {11} 9\\)</span><span style=\"\">x + 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span style=\"\">(</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac {11} 9\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;&times; <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac {9}{11}\\)</span>&nbsp;+ 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">(</span><span style=\"\">1&nbsp;+ 5)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 6</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 216</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; Required answer is 216.</strong></p>\n",
