    {
      "id": "1a1e8ecf68c0-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If x + y + z = 17, xy + yz + zx = 85, then the value of \\(\\sqrt{\\frac{x^3 + y^3 + z^3 - 3xyz}{8}}\\) is what percentage of 2(x + y + z)?",
      "questionHtml": "If x + y + z = 17, xy + yz + zx = 85, then the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{\\frac{x^3 + y^3 + z^3 - 3xyz}{8}}\\)</span> is what percentage of 2(x + y + z)?&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "30%",
          "html": "30%"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "24%",
          "html": "24%"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "25%",
          "html": "25%"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "20%",
          "html": "20%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>x + y + z = 17, xy + yz + zx = 85</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp; = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2xy + 2yz + 2zx</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = (x + y + z) (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>x + y + z = 17&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;----- (1)</p>\n\n<p>On squaring both sides, we get</p>\n\n<p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp; = (17)<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2xy + 2yz + 2zx = 289</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx) = 289</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(85) = 289</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ z<sup>2</sup> + 170 = 289</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 289 - 170</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 119&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ---- (1)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ y</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ z</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- 3xyz = (x + y + z) (x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ y</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ z</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- xy - yz - zx)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;(17) [119 - (xy + yz + zx)] (from 1)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;17 [119 - 85] (Given)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;17&nbsp;&times; 34</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;578</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;2(x&nbsp;+ y&nbsp;+ z) = 2&nbsp;&times; 17</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>34</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(√{\\frac{x^3 + y^3 + z^3 - 3xyz}{8}}\\)</span></span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;&radic;578/8</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>&radic;72.25</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>8.5</p>\n\n<p>Required percentage = (8.5/34)&nbsp;&times; 100</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>25%</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(√{\\frac{x^3 + y^3 + z^3 - 3xyz}{8}}\\)</span>&nbsp;is 25% of 2(x + y + z).</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
